{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BERSERKER'S DOMAIN</strong> is a fast-paced, unhinged retro FPS freakshow with a roguelike loop, inspired by classics like <i>Blood</i>, <i>Quake 1-3</i>, and <i>Doom</i>, as well as modern shooters like <i>Dusk</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and <i>Doom Eternal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve died \u2014 only to be unleashed into an afterlife full of <strong>ultraviolence</strong>, <strong>explosions</strong>, <strong>gibs</strong>, <strong>fun</strong>, and <strong>fresh</strong>\u00a0<strong>victims</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dash, and double-jump around the battlefield at <strong>break-neck speed</strong>, tearing through swarms of cultists, demons, monsters, soldiers, sorcerers, and demigods.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a brutal arsenal of <strong>nasty-ass weapons</strong>, each with a bunch of <strong>nonsense upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate &quot;synergy upgrades&quot; that combine bonuses from different weapons. Want a Dynamite that explodes into shotgun pellets? Sure, why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the\u00a0<strong>Play</strong>\u00a0button and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menus, no waiting for load screens, no tutorials. Just run the game and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death starts a new, <strong>randomized run</strong> with fresh maps, weapons, upgrades, and enemies. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hunt. RAMPAGE</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277520?t=1758530488","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277520?t=1758530488","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/f1fb5e07577b4f727e5ce34b577137b7d6f2a358/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758530488","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/f1fb5e07577b4f727e5ce34b577137b7d6f2a358/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758530488","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains depictions of violence - specifically combat scenes including firearms, melee weapons, blood and gore."},"demos":[{"appid":3977810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/5110ce462895aae7f6f2b4a418b0179f.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BERSERKER'S DOMAIN</strong> is a fast-paced, unhinged retro FPS freakshow with a roguelike loop, inspired by classics like <i>Blood</i>, <i>Quake 1-3</i>, and <i>Doom</i>, as well as modern shooters like <i>Dusk</i>, <i>ULTRAKILL</i>, and <i>Doom Eternal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve died \u2014 only to be unleashed into an afterlife full of <strong>ultraviolence</strong>, <strong>explosions</strong>, <strong>gibs</strong>, <strong>fun</strong>, and <strong>fresh</strong>\u00a0<strong>victims</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/9e590810d01bf46a9a3ab8b990600749.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, dash, and double-jump around the battlefield at <strong>break-neck speed</strong>, tearing through swarms of cultists, demons, monsters, soldiers, sorcerers, and demigods.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a brutal arsenal of <strong>nasty-ass weapons</strong>, each with a bunch of <strong>nonsense upgrades</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate &quot;synergy upgrades&quot; that combine bonuses from different weapons. Want a Dynamite that explodes into shotgun pellets? Sure, why not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.poster.avif?t=1758530488\" width=616 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.webm?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/extras/aa6e10302441a835085b65e04f57ac99.mp4?t=1758530488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the\u00a0<strong>Play</strong>\u00a0button and you're shooting stuff in 5 seconds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No menus, no waiting for load screens, no tutorials. Just run the game and have fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each death starts a new, <strong>randomized run</strong> with fresh maps, weapons, upgrades, and enemies. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hunt. RAMPAGE</strong></p>","developers":["breakky"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277520/header.jpg?t=1758530488","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITS</h2><br>Berserker's Domain uses some of the assets (textures and parts of map geometry) from <i>FreeDoom</i> project.<br>These assets are licensed under the following BSD license:<br><br>Copyright \u00a9 2001-2024 Contributors to the Freedoom project. All rights reserved.<br>Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:<br>Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.<br>Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the documentation and/or other materials provided with the distribution.<br>Neither the name of the Freedoom project nor the names of its contributors may be used to endorse or promote products derived from this software without specific prior written permission.<br>THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND CONTRIBUTORS \u201cAS IS\u201d AND ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WA